'''Unrelenting Force''' is a [[Skyrim:Shout|shout]] that pushes objects and entities. Weak versions of the shout stagger enemies and slightly push objects, while the strongest version will throw objects a great distance and turn enemies into a ragdoll, briefly rendering them helpless.

When you first meet the [[Skyrim:Greybeards|Greybeards]] they will insist that you identify yourself as Dragonborn by your use of this shout on [[Skyrim:Arngeir|Arngeir]].

